>じめん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>埋<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>める。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">狗经常把骨头埋在地面上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">敬う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うやまう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尊敬；敬重；崇敬；敬仰；敬拜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"162200\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>年上<rp>(</rp><rt>としうえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>敬<rp>(</rp><rt>うやま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うように<ruby>教<rp>(</rp><rt>おし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我被教导尊重老人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">末</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">顶端；尖端</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">裏</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">反面；底面；另一面；隐藏的一面；背面；后面；背后；后方；衬里；内层；暗地里；幕后；背地里；背着某人；隐情；深层含义；性格的另一面；未知的情况；不同的方面；证明；相反；与预期相反；与常理相反；（逻辑）否命题（同时否定条件与结论）；后攻半局（棒球等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75059\"><ruby>靴<rp>(</rp><rt>くつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>裏<rp>(</rp><rt>うら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にガムがこびりついちゃった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">鞋子背后有&lt;unk&gt;子。</span></div></li