-w\" lang=\"ja\">売上</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うりあげ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">销售额；销售收入；收益；进账；营业额</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"171359\"><ruby>今年<rp>(</rp><rt>ことし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げは<ruby>倍増<rp>(</rp><rt>ばいぞう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>見込<rp>(</rp><rt>みこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">预计今年的销售额将增加一倍。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">売り切れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うりきれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">售罄；售完；脱销</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142097\"><ruby>切符<rp>(</rp><rt>きっぷ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすべて<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所有的门票都卖掉了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">売り切れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うりきれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">售罄；售完；卖完</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213232\">そのケーキはすぐに<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れるでしょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">蛋糕很快就卖掉了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">売り出し</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うりだし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">特价销售；大减价；促销</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"231302\">あのデパートでは<ruby>今週<rp>(</rp><rt>こんしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>メンズスーツが<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这家公寓本周将出售男士服装。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">売り出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うりだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">推向市场；推出销售；开始销售；上市销售；走红；变得受欢迎</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225461\">クリスマスは<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しいおもちゃを<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すいい<ruby>機会<rp>(</rp><rt>きかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">圣诞节是出售新玩具的好机会。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">売り場</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うりば</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">销售区；柜台；（商场的）楼层；部门；（商品的）畅销时机；好卖的时候</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214581\">スナック<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>場<rp>(</rp><rt>ば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、どこですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">雪茄店在哪里?</span></div></li>","<l